//
// REQUIRES: ryzen_ai_npu1, peano, torch
// REQUIRES: makefile_examples
//
// group2's four preloaded LUTs (32768 + 32768 + 32768 + 20064 int16
// entries, ~231KB total) don't fit in one AIE tile's local memory
// (basic-sequential allocation reports only ~21KB free), so this fails at
// compile time, not just numerically. Needs a real redesign (splitting the
// LUTs across tiles or DMA-streaming them) before this can pass.
// XFAIL: *
//
// RUN: mkdir -p test_placed_group2
// RUN: cd test_placed_group2
// RUN: cp -r %S/data .
// RUN: make -f %S/Makefile clean
// RUN: %run_on_npu1% make -f %S/Makefile targetname=group2 run_py
// RUN: make -f %S/Makefile clean
// RUN: %run_on_npu1% make -f %S/Makefile targetname=group2 trace_py
